From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] dcomp: surface handles and window surfaces (3626)

dcomp: surface handles, CreateSurfaceFromHandle/Hwnd, CreateCompositionSurfaceForHandle

DCompositionCreateSurfaceHandle (was a stub export) makes a small shared
memory section that can be duplicated into other processes.
IDCompositionDevice::CreateSurfaceFromHandle / CreateSurfaceFromHwnd and
ICompositorInterop::CreateCompositionSurfaceForHandle resolve such a handle
to a surface (E_INVALIDARG for anything else); a window surface is sized to
the client area and holds a copy of the window's contents. Browser check at
integration (video overlays).
---
